# 66. Acceptance Criteria — P1

- [ ] Core Web Vitals are measured
- [ ] bundle sizes are reviewed
- [ ] large dependencies are justified
- [ ] route-level code splitting exists where useful
- [ ] below-the-fold heavy components are lazy loaded
- [ ] images are optimized
