# 73. Final Engineering Principle

MAKATA.ai should demonstrate sophisticated engineering without requiring sophisticated infrastructure merely to browse it.

The website should feel:

**fast enough to invite curiosity,**

**accessible enough not to exclude people,**

**responsive enough to disappear,**

and

**technical enough to make the engineering itself visible.**

The ultimate test is not:

> “Did we achieve a perfect performance score?”

It is:

> **“Could a visitor on an ordinary phone discover, understand, and interact with the engineering before the website gets in their way?”**

If yes, the performance architecture is doing its job.
